The Ostrich, Plate VII — a documentary short in the Copperplate Engraving style
================================================================================

Directed and produced by Super Z (Z.ai agent) with the Lemo-Opuscar library.
Every frame, every note and every cut was written in code: canvas 2D rendered
frame by frame in headless Chrome, original score from free sample libraries and
physical modelling, text-to-speech narration, procedural foley. No video
generation, no stock footage.

Film
  ostrich-plate.mp4      1920×1080 · 24 fps · 58 s · −14 LUFS · H.264 + AAC
  ostrich-plate.srt      subtitles (also burned in)
